1
00:04:35,454 --> 00:04:41,454
One thousand brides. One hundred million dollars. Jimmie
Shannon is about to discover the true value of love.

2
00:09:10,909 --> 00:09:16,909
The Bachelor is a comedy, romance film directed by Gary Sinyor.

3
00:13:46,363 --> 00:13:52,363
Jimmie is seeing his single friends get married one by one.

4
00:18:21,818 --> 00:18:27,818
He isn't too worried until his girlfriend Anne catches
the bouquet at his friend Marco's wedding.

5
00:22:57,272 --> 00:23:03,272
Suddenly, his wild mustang days are numbered.

6
00:27:32,727 --> 00:27:38,727
He finally decides to propose to her, but he sticks his
foot in his mouth and botches the proposal.

7
00:32:08,181 --> 00:32:14,181
Being insulted by the defeatist proposal, Anne leaves town on an assignment.

8
00:36:43,636 --> 00:36:49,636
After she's gone, he finds out that his recently-deceased grandfather's will stipulates that he gets nothing of
a multi-million dollar fortune unless he's married by 6:05pm on his 30th birthday: tomorrow!

9
00:41:19,090 --> 00:41:25,090
Not being able to find Anne, Jimmie begins backtracking
through his past girlfriends to find a wife.

10
00:45:54,545 --> 00:46:00,545
Jimmie, played by Chris O'Donnell.

11
00:50:30,000 --> 00:50:36,000
Anne, played by Renée Zellweger.

12
00:55:05,454 --> 00:55:11,454
Marco, played by Artie Lange.

13
00:59:40,909 --> 00:59:46,909
Gluckman, played by Ed Asner.

14
01:04:16,363 --> 01:04:22,363
O'Dell, played by Hal Holbrook.

15
01:08:51,818 --> 01:08:57,818
Priest, played by James Cromwell.

16
01:13:27,272 --> 01:13:33,272
The Bachelor is a 1999 American romantic comedy-drama fantasy film
directed by Gary Sinyor and written by Steve Cohen.

17
01:18:02,727 --> 01:18:08,727
It is a remake of the 1925 Buster Keaton silent comedy film Seven
Chances and stars Chris O'Donnell and Renée Zellweger.

18
01:22:38,181 --> 01:22:44,181
The film received negative reviews from critics and grossed
$36.9 million against its $21 million budget.

19
01:27:13,636 --> 01:27:19,636
This film also marks Mariah Carey's acting debut.

20
01:31:49,090 --> 01:31:55,090
The film explores themes of san francisco, california,
bachelor, remake, inheritance, wedding.

21
01:36:24,545 --> 01:36:30,545
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
